  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 502.13 “Signature line” means no written remarks, other than the applicant's signature, shall be permitted in the area designated for the signature.\n\nSource. #13521, eff 1-13-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500)",
